config DRM_SUN8I_G2D
	tristate "Allwinner G2D 2D Graphics Accelerator"
	depends on (ARM || ARM64) && HAS_IOMEM
	select DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	help
	  Choose this option if you have an Allwinner SoC with the G2D
	  2D graphics accelerator (T113, D1, etc.).
	  
	  This driver provides a character device (/dev/g2d) with custom
	  UAPI ioctls optimized for UI/graphics acceleration. It supports:
	  - Hardware-accelerated blits and fills
	  - DMA-BUF import/export for zero-copy
	  - Sync fences for coordination with DRM/GPU
	  - Rotation, scaling, and format conversion
	  
	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called sunxi-g2d.
